## 🎯 Why I Built This

Starting college with a goal of becoming a strong computer science student, I wanted to use the summer to build a habit of **learning by making**.

These projects are intentionally small. They represent the beginning of my programming journey rather than finished products.

The next stage is to move from small command-line programs toward:

* Data structures and algorithms
* Object-oriented programming
* Git and collaborative development
* Software engineering practices
* Larger projects
* Artificial intelligence and machine learning

